38:41Z","body":"> I'm aware this might not get accepted at its current stage since it's only implemented on Mac.\r\n\r\nCurrently the only gesture-aware platforms are Linux/BSD (Wayland only), MacOS (covered by this PR) and Android.\r\n\r\nWayland exposes rotation through the pinch gesture. I can help with that.\r\n\r\nAndroid seems to not expose a \"rotation gesture detector\" out of the box but I think that it shouldn't be an issue there either. Not my field though, so please take it with a grain of salt.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3737651288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]